OL,3,ANo 10 insists RAF Fairford is safe
OL,4,Aafter US withdraws bombers
OL,5,
OL,6,FDowning Street has insisted RAF
OL,7,FFairford is safe, after the US withdrew
OL,8,Fall of its bombers from the military
OL,9,Fbase.
OL,11,FThe Pentagon confirmed on Sunday it had
OL,12,Fremoved its bombers - thought to be
OL,13,Fabout a dozen B-1s - from the base back
OL,14,Fto their home stations in America.
OL,16,FUS media reported a new threat led to
OL,17,Fthe bombers being removed, which
OL,18,Ffollows a major incident on 27
OL,19,FSeptember when police were alerted to
OL,20,Fthree "suspicious vehicles" near the
OL,21,Fairbase.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
