OL,3,AFlydubai co-pilot planned to crash
OL,4,Aplane into Tel Aviv airport or
OL,5,Abuilding, reports say
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe attacked and wounded the captain
OL,8,Fwith the emergency crash axe kept in
OL,9,Fthe cockpit before being overpowered by
OL,10,Fpassengers. Another crew travelling on
OL,11,Fthe plane was able to land it in Saudi
OL,12,FArabia.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
